        {
          "assumption_id": "RW41",
          "statement": "For 0<sigma<=1 and 0<k<=2, incident delta-tube pencils of common cardinality M over a (delta,k,delta^(-eta))-set of pins, with each pencil a (delta,sigma,delta^(-eta))-set, have union cardinality at least a constant times M delta^(-min(k,(k+sigma)/2,1)+epsilon), for eta sufficiently small depending on epsilon,k,sigma.",
