      "natural_statement": "For every realizing sequence of bounded planar laws with time Frostman exponent 0<s<=1, positive tilt exponent, and the stated affine hereditary simultaneous-refinement bounds, the dense-strip and power-light-strip conclusions of proj:product hold uniformly under arbitrary dense incidences. With the stated matched spatial support and weight realizations, the equal-slope rates satisfy g,H>=f_s(p). The nonlinear mechanism has the explicit finite bound recorded in CP_NONLINEAR_CHAIN.",
